    "final_message": "I finished the trial and committed the work as a1493f3. `scripts/verify story-drafting` passes tessercheck, mypy --strict and every non-root test tier, then fails the root tier with 1 failed, 1 passed.\n\n- **s-1-a-1 test:** it POSTs a job to be done to `/jtbds` and asserts 201, a `jtbd_id`, and status `drafting_stories`. It passes, because the generated stub already answers `drafting_stories` as its status.\n- **s-2-a-1 test:** it fails at its *then*. The host answers 200, but the stub status stays `drafting_stories` and there are no stories, so the test hits `AssertionError: assert 'drafting_stories' == 'awaiting_story_acceptance'`.\n- **Least sure of:** the `accept_stories` signal (its payload is only `jtbd_id`), and the 8-second poll window in the s-2 test.\n\nThe tests are in `story-drafting/tests/test_story_drafting.py`, and the specs are in `story-drafting/specs/`. The full verify output is in `<repo>/.baseline-runs/red-s1-sonnet-low-3/verify.log`."
